{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>蘇黎世保險(香港)懷疑發生資料外洩，暫未知涉及人數。</p><p></p><p>蘇黎世保險(香港)向客戶通報，指周二偵測到懷疑被黑客入侵。初步調查顯示，有客戶個人資料，包括姓名、身份證號碼、保單資料等或被未經授權存取。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PRIVACY-1700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LxldrngtGy1795089510.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>暫無證據顯示涉及銀行戶口、信用卡等，已暫時停用相關網上平台，並通知受影響客戶。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.247770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.430435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:32.373095+00:00","content_hash":"253e5712082856cdb9fc1d9a5260a2f69a4e79cb9cdea2fef7f157e2d9cc2798","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.247770+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}